    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870110/extras/c70e1fa53c5ccb977ad9928bc1a2fcd7.webp?t=1549893078\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870110/extras/810ed5f22ea96a95dc8dab960276b293.avif?t=1549893078\" /></div><br>Satoru, a grade one student in Hoshikawa Highschool who is gentle and clever, is the heroine of this game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870110/extras/87839a31d659081c59eb13883649ba6c.avif?t=1549893078\" /></div><br>Hashi, a grade two student in Hoshikawa Highschool of integrity and bold, is the hero of this game.<br><br>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870110/extras/f041c8b31cc9c69993460f5edf49c98d.webp?t=1549893078\" /></div><br><br>When turning back school at night to find the key he left, what Hashi met are the girl who also left her key there,<br><br> a small bear dyed red by Satoru\uff0c the Ghost Hand in the corner,  the black figure and the strange sound.<br><br>Is the unrealistic place where the two met at a coincidence or a destined?<br><br>Beyond horrible, odd and black feelings, while there is a sincere relationship.<br><br>However,<br><br>The horrors more terrible than all these, become increasingly clear as the two linger around in the school. <br><br>The nervous history of the bizarre deaths replays again as the history book be opened.<br>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870110/extras/eeff4049aa3fb2ff96b4e4b8f2bb381e.avif?t=1549893078\" /></div><br><br>*14 different game endings<br><br>*An experience of unique storys in the game<br><br>*A variety of independent puzzles<br><br>*To find a sincere relationship in the finding of clues<br><br>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
